<%@ Page Title="متابعة الشكاوى والاقتراحات" Language="vb" AutoEventWireup="false" MasterPageFile="~/Customer.Master" CodeBehind="Feedback.aspx.vb" Inherits="CRM.CustomerFeedback" %>
<%@ Import Namespace="CRM" %>
<asp:Content ID="head" runat="server" ContentPlaceHolderID="HeadContent"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/vendor/fonts/fontawesome.css" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/vendor/libs/datatables-bs5/datatables.bootstrap5.css" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/crm.css" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/crm-list.css?v=20261021organization" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/vendor/libs/bs-stepper/bs-stepper.css" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/feedback-workspace.css?v=20261022g" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/customer-feedback.css?v=20261022e" /></asp:Content>
<asp:Content ID="body" runat="server" ContentPlaceHolderID="ContentPlaceHolder1">
<div ID="customerFeedbackWorkspace" runat="server" ClientIDMode="Static" class="crm-shell crm-types feedback-workspace" dir="rtl" data-customer-feedback-workspace="1" data-feedback-saved="0">
 <div class="type-page-header type-flex align-items-center justify-content-between"><h1 class="h4 mb-0">متابعة الشكاوى والاقتراحات</h1><nav aria-label="مسار التنقل"><ol class="breadcrumb mb-0"><li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="Dashboard.aspx">الرئيسية</a></li><li class="breadcrumb-item active" aria-current="page">الشكاوى والاقتراحات</li></ol></nav></div>
 <div data-customer-feedback-message="1"><asp:Literal ID="litMessage" runat="server" /></div><div data-customer-feedback-statistics="1"><asp:Literal ID="litStatistics" runat="server" /></div>
 <section class="card" data-customer-feedback-list="1"><div class="card-header type-filter-header"><h2 class="card-title h5 mb-0">تصفية البحث</h2>
  <div class="row g-3 align-items-center"><div class="col-12 col-md-5"><input type="search" class="form-control" placeholder="عنوان الطلب أو رقمه" aria-label="البحث بعنوان الطلب أو رقمه" data-customer-feedback-search="1" /></div><div class="col-12 col-md-3"><select class="form-select" aria-label="العلامة التجارية" data-customer-feedback-brand-filter="1"><option value="">اختر العلامة التجارية</option><asp:Literal ID="litHistoryBrands" runat="server" /></select></div><div class="col-12 col-md-3"><select class="form-select" aria-label="حالة الطلب" data-customer-feedback-status="1"><option value="">اختر الحالة</option><option value="1">جديد</option><option value="2">قيد المعالجة</option><option value="3">مغلق</option></select></div><div class="col-12 col-md-1 type-flex"><button type="button" class="btn btn-icon btn-label-secondary" data-customer-feedback-reset="1" title="إعادة تعيين الفلاتر" aria-label="إعادة تعيين الفلاتر" data-bs-toggle="tooltip"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-left" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></div></div></div>
  <div id="pnlTableActions" class="type-flex type-toolbar-controls align-items-center"><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-bs-toggle="offcanvas" data-bs-target="#customerFeedbackWizard"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>تقديم طلب جديد</button></div>
  <div class="card-datatable table-responsive"><table id="ERPTable" data-enhanced="1" class="ERP_ProstoTBL card-list-table table border-top crm-table"><thead><tr><th>الرقم</th><th>الطلب</th><th>العلامة / الفرع</th><th>الحالة</th><th>تاريخ التقديم</th><th data-orderable="false">الإجراءات</th></tr></thead><tbody>
  <asp:Repeater ID="history" runat="server"><ItemTemplate><tr data-customer-feedback-row="1" data-feedback-id='<%# Eval("ID") %>' data-brand-id='<%# Eval("Brand_ID") %>' data-status='<%# Eval("Status") %>'><td data-title="الرقم"><%#: Eval("ID") %></td><td data-title="الطلب"><div class="type-record-name"><a class="fw-semibold text-body" data-customer-feedback-title="1" href='FeedbackDetail.aspx?id=<%# Eval("ID") %>'><%#: Eval("Title") %></a><small class="d-block text-muted"><%#: Eval("TypeName") %></small></div></td><td data-title="العلامة / الفرع"><div class="type-cell-details"><span><%#: Eval("Brand_Title_Ar") %></span><small class="d-block text-muted"><%#: Eval("Branch_Title_Ar") %></small></div></td><td data-title="الحالة"><span class='<%# CRM.EmployeeFeedbackData.StatusCss(Eval("Status")) %>'><%#: CRM.EmployeeFeedbackData.StatusText(Eval("Status")) %></span></td><td data-title="تاريخ التقديم"><span dir="ltr"><%#: CRM.EmployeeFeedbackData.LogDate(Eval("AddedDate")) %></span></td><td data-title="الإجراءات"><div class="type-flex type-row-actions"><a class="btn btn-sm btn-icon type-row-action text-secondary" href='FeedbackDetail.aspx?id=<%# Eval("ID") %>' title="عرض تفاصيل الطلب" aria-label="عرض تفاصيل الطلب" data-bs-toggle="tooltip"><i class="fa-solid fa-eye" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></div></td></tr></ItemTemplate></asp:Repeater>
  </tbody></table></div><p data-customer-feedback-empty="1" class="text-center text-muted py-4 mb-0" hidden>لا توجد طلبات مطابقة.</p><div data-customer-feedback-count="1" class="visually-hidden" aria-live="polite"></div>
 </section>
 <div class="offcanvas offcanvas-end feedback-customer-offcanvas" tabindex="-1" id="customerFeedbackWizard" aria-labelledby="customerFeedbackWizardTitle" data-feedback-reopen='<%= If(KeepWizardOpen,"1","0") %>'>
  <div class="offcanvas-header border-bottom"><div><h5 class="offcanvas-title" id="customerFeedbackWizardTitle">تقديم طلب جديد</h5><small class="text-muted">أربع خطوات لإيصال طلبك إلى الإدارة</small></div><button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="offcanvas" aria-label="إغلاق"></button></div>
  <div class="offcanvas-body"><div class="feedback-wizard bs-stepper wizard-numbered" data-feedback-wizard="1" data-feedback-current="0">
   <div class="bs-stepper-header feedback-wizard-steps"><div class="step" data-feedback-indicator="0"><button type="button" class="step-trigger" data-feedback-jump="0"><span class="bs-stepper-circle">1</span><span class="bs-stepper-label"><span class="bs-stepper-title">الفرع</span></span></button></div><div class="line"></div><div class="step" data-feedback-indicator="1"><button type="button" class="step-trigger" data-feedback-jump="1"><span class="bs-stepper-circle">2</span><span class="bs-stepper-label"><span class="bs-stepper-title">الطلب</span></span></button></div><div class="line"></div><div class="step" data-feedback-indicator="2"><button type="button" class="step-trigger" data-feedback-jump="2"><span class="bs-stepper-circle">3</span><span class="bs-stepper-label"><span class="bs-stepper-title">المرفقات</span></span></button></div><div class="line"></div><div class="step" data-feedback-indicator="3"><button type="button" class="step-trigger" data-feedback-jump="3"><span class="bs-stepper-circle">4</span><span class="bs-stepper-label"><span class="bs-stepper-title">الإرسال</span></span></button></div></div>
   <p class="small text-muted" data-feedback-progress="1" aria-live="polite"></p><div data-customer-feedback-wizard-message="1"><asp:Literal ID="litWizardMessage" runat="server" /></div>
   <section data-feedback-step="0"><h6 class="mb-3">اختر العلامة التجارية والفرع</h6><asp:Panel ID="noBranches" runat="server" CssClass="alert alert-warning"><i class="bx bx-info-circle me-2"></i>لا توجد فروع فعّالة مرتبطة بحسابك. تواصل مع إدارة النظام لإضافة ارتباط الفرع قبل تقديم طلب.</asp:Panel><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-12"><asp:Label runat="server" AssociatedControlID="ddlBrand" CssClass="form-label" Text="العلامة التجارية" /><asp:DropDownList ID="ddlBrand" runat="server" CssClass="form-select select2" data-customer-feedback-brand="1" data-feedback-required="1" /></div><div class="col-12"><asp:Label runat="server" AssociatedControlID="ddlBranch" CssClass="form-label" Text="الفرع" /><asp:DropDownList ID="ddlBranch" runat="server" CssClass="form-select select2" data-customer-feedback-branch="1" data-feedback-required="1" /><div class="form-text" data-customer-feedback-no-branch="1" hidden>لا يوجد فرع فعّال مرتبط بحسابك لهذه العلامة. تواصل مع إدارة النظام.</div></div></div></section>
   <section data-feedback-step="1" hidden><h6 class="mb-3">بيانات الطلب</h6><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-md-6"><asp:Label runat="server" AssociatedControlID="ddlType" CssClass="form-label" Text="نوع الطلب" /><asp:DropDownList ID="ddlType" runat="server" CssClass="form-select select2" data-customer-feedback-type="1" data-feedback-required="1" /></div><div class="col-md-6"><asp:Label runat="server" AssociatedControlID="ddlTopic" CssClass="form-label" Text="الموضوع" /><asp:DropDownList ID="ddlTopic" runat="server" CssClass="form-select select2" data-customer-feedback-topic="1" data-feedback-required="1" /></div><div class="col-12"><asp:Label runat="server" AssociatedControlID="txtTitle" CssClass="form-label" Text="عنوان الطلب" /><asp:TextBox ID="txtTitle" runat="server" CssClass="form-control" MaxLength="300" data-feedback-required="1" /></div><div class="col-12"><asp:Label runat="server" AssociatedControlID="txtDetails" CssClass="form-label" Text="التفاصيل" /><asp:TextBox ID="txtDetails" runat="server" CssClass="form-control" TextMode="MultiLine" Rows="5" MaxLength="10000" data-feedback-required="1" /></div><div class="col-12"><asp:Label runat="server" AssociatedControlID="txtMobile" CssClass="form-label" Text="رقم التواصل" /><asp:TextBox ID="txtMobile" runat="server" CssClass="form-control" MaxLength="30" TextMode="Phone" dir="ltr" data-feedback-required="1" /></div></div></section>
   <section data-feedback-step="2" hidden><h6 class="mb-3">المرفقات <span class="small text-muted">(اختياري)</span></h6><asp:Label runat="server" AssociatedControlID="uploads" CssClass="form-label" Text="إرفاق ملفات توضيحية" /><asp:FileUpload ID="uploads" runat="server" CssClass="form-control" AllowMultiple="true" accept=".pdf,.doc,.docx,.xls,.xlsx,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif" data-customer-feedback-files="1" /><div class="form-text">حتى 5 ملفات، 10 ميجابايت للملف. PDF وWord وExcel والصور JPG وPNG وGIF.</div><div data-feedback-upload-status="1" class="small mt-3" aria-live="polite"></div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush mt-3" data-customer-feedback-file-list="1"></ul></section>
   <section data-feedback-step="3" hidden><h6 class="mb-3">الجهة المستلمة والخصوصية</h6><div class="rounded border p-3 mb-3"><div class="d-flex gap-3"><span class="avatar"><span class="avatar-initial rounded bg-label-primary"><i class="bx bx-shield-quarter"></i></span></span><div><strong class="d-block mb-1">إدارة النظام</strong><span class="text-muted small">يُرسل الطلب إلى مديري النظام الفعّالين فقط.</span><div class="small mt-2"><asp:Literal ID="litRecipients" runat="server" Mode="Encode" /></div></div></div></div><div class="alert alert-info mb-0"><i class="bx bx-user-check me-2"></i>تظهر هويتك وبيانات التواصل المسجلة مع الطلب، ولا توجد إمكانية لإخفائها.</div><div class="rounded bg-lighter p-3 mt-3 small" data-customer-feedback-summary="1"></div></section>
   <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2 border-top pt-3 mt-4"><button type="button" class="btn btn-label-secondary" data-feedback-prev="1"><i class="bx bx-chevron-right me-1"></i>السابق</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-feedback-next="1">التالي<i class="bx bx-chevron-left ms-1"></i></button><asp:Button ID="btnSubmit" runat="server" OnClick="Submit_Click" Text="إرسال الطلب" CssClass="btn btn-primary" data-feedback-submit="1" data-customer-feedback-submit="1" /></div>
  </div></div>
 </div>
</div>
<script defer src="/assets/vendor/libs/datatables/jquery.dataTables.js"></script><script defer src="/assets/vendor/libs/datatables-bs5/datatables-bootstrap5.js"></script><script defer src="/assets/js/crm-list.js?v=20261021suppliers"></script><script defer src="/assets/js/feedback-wizard.js?v=20261022b"></script><script defer src="/assets/js/customer-feedback.js?v=20261022e"></script>
</asp:Content>
